t-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;International Business Administration, Design </span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt 3.2pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※첨부된 과정별 지원 자격을 참고할 것. </span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt 3.2pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt 3.2pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;5. 장학금 내역</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 및 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">기타 사항: 붙임 참조 </span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt 3.2pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\">붙임 : 1. 오만 정부초청학부장학생 선발 요강 &nbsp;1부</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\">붙임 : 2. 지원